== Themes ==

Put <code><nowiki>{{Theme|frost}}</nowiki></code> once at the top of a page to change its accent colour: section lines, picture-button panels and every kit component on the page follow it. A single component can use its own colour with <code>theme=</code> or any colour with <code>colour=#55ccff</code>.

{{Columns

|{{Box|title=Gold|theme=gold|Cinder gold (the default)<br><code><nowiki>{{Theme|gold}}</nowiki></code>}}
{{Box|title=Verdant|theme=verdant|Forests, plants, nature<br><code><nowiki>{{Theme|verdant}}</nowiki></code>}}
{{Box|title=Abyss|theme=abyss|Sea, depths, the unknown<br><code><nowiki>{{Theme|abyss}}</nowiki></code>}}
{{Box|title=Plague|theme=plague|Poison, rot, swamps<br><code><nowiki>{{Theme|plague}}</nowiki></code>}}

|{{Box|title=Ember|theme=ember|Fire and forges<br><code><nowiki>{{Theme|ember}}</nowiki></code>}}
{{Box|title=Arcane|theme=arcane|Magic and sorcery<br><code><nowiki>{{Theme|arcane}}</nowiki></code>}}
{{Box|title=Holy|theme=holy|Holy, light, temples<br><code><nowiki>{{Theme|holy}}</nowiki></code>}}

|{{Box|title=Frost|theme=frost|Ice and the north<br><code><nowiki>{{Theme|frost}}</nowiki></code>}}
{{Box|title=Blood|theme=blood|Bosses, danger, war<br><code><nowiki>{{Theme|blood}}</nowiki></code>}}
{{Box|title=Shadow|theme=shadow|Stealth, ruins, the dead<br><code><nowiki>{{Theme|shadow}}</nowiki></code>}}

}}

== Page look ==

=== Theme ===

Changes the accent colour of this page: kit components, heading lines and picture-button panels. Put it once at the top of the page. See [[Template:Theme]] for every option.

=== Banner ===

A large header for the top of a page, with an optional background picture. See [[Template:Banner]] for every option.

{{Banner|title=The Ashlands|subtitle=A scorched waste south of Wendsey|theme=ember}}
{{Banner|kicker=Guide|title=Getting started|align=left}}

{{Collapse|title=Code|open=no|
<pre>
{{Banner|title=The Ashlands|subtitle=A scorched waste south of Wendsey|theme=ember}}
{{Banner|kicker=Guide|title=Getting started|align=left}}
</pre>
}}

=== Divider ===

A decorative line across the page, with an optional word in the middle. See [[Template:Divider]] for every option.

{{Divider}}
{{Divider|Chapter II}}

{{Collapse|title=Code|open=no|
<pre>
{{Divider}}
{{Divider|Chapter II}}
</pre>
}}

== Layout ==

=== Box ===

A panel with an optional title bar. Can float beside the text. See [[Template:Box]] for every option.

{{Box|title=Did you know?|Spears outrange swords by one block.}}
{{Box|title=Quick facts|float=right|width=260px|theme=arcane|
* Fact one
* Fact two
}}

{{Collapse|title=Code|open=no|
<pre>
