== Notices and text ==

=== Callout ===

A coloured notice: tip, note, info, warning, danger, lore or success. See [[Template:Callout]] for every option.

{{Callout|type=tip|Sneak past sleeping bosses to skip the fight.}}
{{Callout|type=warning|title=Careful|Lava below this bridge.}}
{{Callout|type=lore|The old kings buried their dead with their blades.}}

{{Collapse|title=Code|open=no|
